.wrangler/

# Installers are DEPLOYED, not stored in history.
#
# Cloudflare uploads whatever is in this folder at deploy time, so the files do
# not need to be committed to be published. Committing them was making the
# repository grow by 15-30 MB per release and never shrink: 448 MB of history
# to serve 55 MB of current downloads, and no way to get it back.
#
# They stay on disk, they still deploy, the repository stops growing.
download/*.AppImage
download/*.deb
download/*.tar.gz
download/*.zip
download/*.exe
download/SHA256SUMS
